<title>USA: North Bancshares to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>North Bancshares to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Banchsares Inc said Tuesday it plans to repurchase 50,000 shares of its common stock, about five percent of its outstanding shares.</p>
<p>This is the eighth repurchase program initiated by the company.</p>
<p>Repurchases will be made in the open market or in privately negotiated transactions over a period of one year.</p>
<p>North Bancshares stock was up 3/8 at 20-1/2 Tuesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
